OL,3,GNEWSAHow a reservoir is helping to save
OL,4,Adeclining bird
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site, run by Severn Trent Water,
OL,7,Fhas been trying to improve the outlook
OL,8,Ffor the species as part of its wider
OL,9,Finitiative to boost the area's
OL,10,Fbiodiversity.
